"view.secondaryscreen.help"               = "Enigma calculates secondary directions for the most recently selected horoscope. If multiple horoscopes are active, you can make a different choice.\n\nTo calculate a secondary direction, you must select an event. If needed, you can create a new event.\n\nClick the 'Calculate' button and you will see the secondary directions in the middle part of the screen. To calculate secondary directions for a different event, choose a different event and click 'Calculate' again.";
